commands.description:
write codegen/Generators.cs (the generator list),
codegen/Program.cs and codegen/Codegen.csproj;
--with-docs lists the api-docs generator in it
gen [<metadataDir>] --out <dir> [--namespace <ns>] [--emit-abstract-shapes]
[--generators <a,b,c>] [--template-root <dir>] [--strict]
run the generator list in codegen/Generators.cs;
--generators narrows it to the entries named;
--strict rejects an unknown @attr before writing
(as verify does, ADR-0023; default is a warning)
